- **Context window:** Historical advertised 1,048,576 context / 270,000 output in models.dev; no current serving test or full-window retrieval measurement.
- **Modalities:** Historical text/image/video/PDF inputs, text output; reasoning, tools, and structured outputs listed. No native audio or non-text output verified.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Historical catalog records $0 input/output/cache read; deprecated status and live-catalog omission prevent presenting this as an available free entitlement. No current paid tariff or model-specific data-use terms verified.
- **Architecture:** Catalog says closed weights; parameter counts, maker, license, and lineage unverified.

